      "id": "arithmetic-04-001",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "The sum of two numbers is 25 and their difference is 13. Find their product.",
      "options": {
        "A": "104",
        "B": "114",
        "C": "315",
        "D": "325"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "x+y=25, x-y=13. Solving gives x=19, y=6. Product = 19*6 = 114.",
      "hash": "dfd659e9ed0c4a90",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "दो संख्याओं का योग 25 है और उनका अंतर 13 है। उनका गुणनफल ज्ञात कीजिए।",
          "options": {
            "A": "104",
            "B": "114",
            "C": "315",
            "D": "325"
          },
          "explanation": "x+y=25, x-y=13. हल करने पर x=19, y=6 प्राप्त होता है। गुणनफल = 19*6 = 114."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "arithmetic-04-002",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "Find the value of 0.008 ^ (1/3).",
      "options": {
        "A": "0.02",
        "B": "0.2",
        "C": "0.002",
        "D": "2"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "0.2 * 0.2 * 0.2 = 0.008. So the cube root is 0.2.",
      "hash": "b7593c969df7ec18",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "0.008 ^ (1/3) का मान ज्ञात कीजिए।",
          "options": {
            "A": "0.02",
            "B": "0.2",
            "C": "0.002",
            "D": "2"
          },
          "explanation": "0.2 * 0.2 * 0.2 = 0.008. अतः घनमूल 0.2 है।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "arithmetic-04-003",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "If a man reduces his speed to 2/3, he takes 1 hour more to reach his destination. Find his usual time.",
      "options": {
        "A": "1 hour",
        "B": "2 hours",
        "C": "3 hours",
        "D": "1.5 hours"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "Speed ratio 3:2, Time ratio 2:3. Difference 1 unit = 1 hour. Usual time = 2 units = 2 hours.",
      "hash": "5957a2d0f0caba8b",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "यदि कोई व्यक्ति अपनी गति को घटाकर 2/3 कर देता है, तो उसे अपने गंतव्य तक पहुँचने में 1 घंटा अधिक लगता है। उसका सामान्य समय ज्ञात कीजिए।",
          "options": {
            "A": "1 घंटा",
            "B": "2 घंटे",
            "C": "3 घंटे",
            "D": "1.5 घंटे"
          },
          "explanation": "गति का अनुपात 3:2, समय का अनुपात 2:3। अंतर 1 इकाई = 1 घंटा। सामान्य समय = 2 इकाई = 2 घंटे।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "arithmetic-04-004",
      "number": 4,
      "question": "The diagonal of a rectangle is 10 cm and its area is 48 sq.cm. Find the perimeter.",
      "options": {
        "A": "14 cm",
        "B": "28 cm",
        "C": "32 cm",
        "D": "40 cm"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "l^2+b^2=100, lb=48. (l+b)^2 = 100 + 2(48) = 196. l+b=14. Perimeter = 2(14) = 28.",
      "hash": "ce7c4465b3b7201c",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "एक आयत का विकर्ण 10 सेमी है और इसका क्षेत्रफल 48 वर्ग सेमी है। परिमाप ज्ञात कीजिए।",
          "options": {
            "A": "14 सेमी",
            "B": "28 सेमी",
            "C": "32 सेमी",
            "D": "40 सेमी"
          },
          "explanation": "l^2+b^2=100, lb=48. (l+b)^2 = 100 + 2(48) = 196. l+b=14. परिमाप = 2(14) = 28."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "arithmetic-04-005",
      "number": 5,
      "question": "A man buys 12 apples for Rs. 15 and sells 10 apples for Rs. 15. Find his profit percentage.",
      "options": {
        "A": "10%",
        "B": "15%",
        "C": "20%",
        "D": "25%"
      },
      "answer": "C",
      "explanation": "Profit = (12-10)/10 * 100 = 2/10 * 100 = 20%.",
      "hash": "b987b5e0b4373ffd",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "एक व्यक्ति 15 रुपये में 12 सेब खरीदता है और 15 रुपये में 10 सेब बेचता है। उसका लाभ प्रतिशत ज्ञात कीजिए।",
          "options": {
            "A": "10%",
            "B": "15%",
            "C": "20%",
            "D": "25%"
          },
          "explanation": "लाभ = (12-10)/10 * 100 = 2/10 * 100 = 20%."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "arithmetic-04-006",
      "number": 6,
      "question": "If 35% of a number is 175, then what is 175% of that number?",
      "options": {
        "A": "500",
        "B": "750",
        "C": "875",
        "D": "925"
      },
      "answer": "C",
      "explanation": "35% = 175 => 1% = 5. 175% = 175 * 5 = 875.",
      "hash": "ac74618cd262e47c",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "यदि किसी संख्या का 35% 175 है, तो उस संख्या का 175% क्या है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "500",
            "B": "750",
            "C": "875",
            "D": "925"
          },
          "explanation": "35% = 175 => 1% = 5. 175% = 175 * 5 = 875."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "arithmetic-04-007",
      "number": 7,
      "question": "A cylinder's radius is 14 cm and height is 5 cm. Find its Curved Surface Area.",
      "options": {
        "A": "220 cm²",
        "B": "440 cm²",
        "C": "880 cm²",
        "D": "616 cm²"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "CSA = 2 * pi * r * h = 2 * (22/7) * 14 * 5 = 440.",
      "hash": "dd4bfea8f9e82710",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "एक बेलन की त्रिज्या 14 सेमी और ऊँचाई 5 सेमी है। इसका वक्र पृष्ठीय क्षेत्रफल ज्ञात कीजिए।",
          "options": {
            "A": "220 सेमी²",
            "B": "440 सेमी²",
            "C": "880 सेमी²",
            "D": "616 सेमी²"
          },
          "explanation": "CSA = 2 * pi * r * h = 2 * (22/7) * 14 * 5 = 440."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "arithmetic-04-008",
      "number": 8,
      "question": "A sum of Rs. 8000 yields Rs. 1261 as compound interest in 3 years. Find the rate of interest.",
      "options": {
        "A": "5%",
        "B": "10%",
        "C": "15%",
        "D": "2%"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Amount = 8000+1261=9261. (1+R/100)^3 = 9261/8000 = (21/20)^3. R/100 = 1/20 => R=5%.",
      "hash": "78e411abeb636b6c",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "8000 रुपये की राशि पर 3 वर्षों में 1261 रुपये चक्रवृद्धि ब्याज प्राप्त होता है। ब्याज की दर ज्ञात कीजिए।",
          "options": {
            "A": "5%",
            "B": "10%",
            "C": "15%",
            "D": "2%"
          },
          "explanation": "मिश्रधन = 9261. (1+R/100)^3 = 9261/8000 = (21/20)^3. R/100 = 1/20 => R=5%."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "arithmetic-04-009",
      "number": 9,
      "question": "The ratio of two numbers is 3:8 and their difference is 115. Find the larger number.",
      "options": {
        "A": "184",
        "B": "194",
        "C": "230",
        "D": "69"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "8x - 3x = 115 => 5x = 115 => x = 23. Larger number = 8 * 23 = 184.",
      "hash": "9a09b6bf23c858f0",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "दो संख्याओं का अनुपात 3:8 है और उनका अंतर 115 है। बड़ी संख्या ज्ञात कीजिए।",
          "options": {
            "A": "184",
            "B": "194",
            "C": "230",
            "D": "69"
          },
          "explanation": "8x - 3x = 115 => 5x = 115 => x = 23। बड़ी संख्या = 8 * 23 = 184."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "arithmetic-04-010",
      "number": 10,
      "question": "A tap can fill a tank in 6 hours. After half the tank is filled, three more similar taps are opened. Total time to fill tank?",
      "options": {
        "A": "3h 45m",
        "B": "4h",
        "C": "4h 15m",
        "D": "3h 15m"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "First half = 3h. Remaining half is done by 4 taps. Time = (3h / 4) = 45m. Total = 3h 45m.",
      "hash": "9feaeef2290a174b",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "एक नल एक टैंक को 6 घंटे में भर सकता है। टैंक आधा भरने के बाद, इसी तरह के तीन और नल खोल दिए जाते हैं। टैंक को भरने में कुल समय?",
          "options": {
            "A": "3घं 45मि",
            "B": "4घं",
            "C": "4घं 15मि",
            "D": "3घं 15मि"
          },
          "explanation": "पहला आधा = 3घं। शेष आधा 4 नलों द्वारा किया जाता है। समय = (3घं / 4) = 45मि। कुल = 3घं 45मि।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "arithmetic-04-011",
      "number": 11,
      "question": "Average age of 15 students is 18 years. If the teacher's age is added, average becomes 19. Find teacher's age.",
      "options": {
        "A": "33",
        "B": "34",
        "C": "35",
        "D": "36"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "Teacher = (16 * 19) - (15 * 18) = 304 - 270 = 34.",
      "hash": "60d5719f15d1e51e",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "15 छात्रों की औसत आयु 18 वर्ष है। यदि शिक्षक की आयु जोड़ दी जाए, तो औसत 19 हो जाता है। शिक्षक की आयु ज्ञात कीजिए।",
          "options": {
            "A": "33",
            "B": "34",
            "C": "35",
            "D": "36"
          },
          "explanation": "शिक्षक = (16 * 19) - (15 * 18) = 304 - 270 = 34."
        }
      }
    },
