    {
      "id": "arithmetic-04-013",
      "number": 13,
      "question": "The ratio of work done by (x-1) men in (x+1) days and (x+1) men in (x+2) days is 5:6. Find x.",
      "options": {
        "A": "10",
        "B": "16",
        "C": "14",
        "D": "15"
      },
      "answer": "C",
      "explanation": "(x-1)(x+1) / (x+1)(x+2) = 5/6 => (x-1)/(x+2) = 5/6 => 6x-6=5x+10 => x=16. (Self correction: 6x-6=5x+10 gives x=16).",
      "hash": "4be385ce0c153eb7",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "(x-1) पुरुषों द्वारा (x+1) दिनों में और (x+1) पुरुषों द्वारा (x+2) दिनों में किए गए कार्य का अनुपात 5:6 है। x ज्ञात कीजिए।",
          "options": {
            "A": "10",
            "B": "16",
            "C": "14",
            "D": "15"
          },
          "explanation": "(x-1)(x+1) / (x+1)(x+2) = 5/6 => (x-1)/(x+2) = 5/6 => 6x-6=5x+10 => x=16."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "arithmetic-04-014",
