      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "All numbers are divisible by 36. 108=36*3, 288=36*8, 360=36*10.",
      "hash": "de9b933a7870c64a",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "108, 288 और 360 का HCF ज्ञात कीजिए।",
          "options": {
            "A": "18",
            "B": "36",
            "C": "54",
            "D": "72"
          },
          "explanation": "सभी संख्याएं 36 से विभाज्य हैं। 108=36*3, 288=36*8, 360=36*10."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "arithmetic-04-015",
      "number": 15,
      "question": "A person borrows Rs. 5000 for 2 years at 4% p.a. simple interest. He lends it to another person at 6.25% p.a. for 2 years. Find his gain in the transaction.",
      "options": {
        "A": "Rs. 112.50",
        "B": "Rs. 225",
        "C": "Rs. 150",
        "D": "Rs. 250"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "Gain % per year = 6.25 - 4 = 2.25%. Gain for 2 years = 4.5% of 5000 = 225.",
      "hash": "3bbd1c74203366f5",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "एक व्यक्ति 4% वार्षिक साधारण ब्याज पर 2 वर्षों के लिए 5000 रुपये उधार लेता है। वह इसे 6.25% वार्षिक दर पर 2 वर्षों के लिए दूसरे व्यक्ति को देता है। उसका लाभ ज्ञात कीजिए।",
          "options": {
            "A": "112.50 रुपये",
            "B": "225 रुपये",
            "C": "150 रुपये",
            "D": "250 रुपये"
          },
          "explanation": "प्रति वर्ष लाभ % = 6.25 - 4 = 2.25%। 2 वर्षों के लिए लाभ = 5000 का 4.5% = 225."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "arithmetic-04-016",
      "number": 16,
      "question": "A circular wire of radius 42 cm is cut and bent in form of a square. Find the side of the square.",
      "options": {
        "A": "33 cm",
        "B": "66 cm",
        "C": "42 cm",
        "D": "132 cm"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "Circumference = 2 * (22/7) * 42 = 264. Side of square = 264 / 4 = 66.",
      "hash": "893bd28b936514ce",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "42 सेमी त्रिज्या वाले एक गोलाकार तार को काटकर एक वर्ग के रूप में मोड़ा जाता है। वर्ग की भुजा ज्ञात कीजिए।",
          "options": {
            "A": "33 सेमी",
            "B": "66 सेमी",
            "C": "42 सेमी",
            "D": "132 सेमी"
          },
          "explanation": "परिधि = 2 * (22/7) * 42 = 264। वर्ग की भुजा = 264 / 4 = 66."
        }
      }
    },
