      "id": "arithmetic-04-034",
      "number": 34,
      "question": "The probability of getting a sum of 7 when two dice are thrown is?",
      "options": {
        "A": "1/6",
        "B": "1/12",
        "C": "1/9",
        "D": "5/36"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Possible outcomes for 7: (1,6), (6,1), (2,5), (5,2), (3,4), (4,3) = 6. Total = 36. Prob = 6/36 = 1/6.",
      "hash": "9c717b516b1a2c35",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "दो पासे फेंकने पर योग 7 आने की प्रायिकता क्या है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "1/6",
            "B": "1/12",
            "C": "1/9",
            "D": "5/36"
          },
          "explanation": "7 के लिए संभावित परिणाम: 6। कुल = 36। प्रायिकता = 6/36 = 1/6."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "arithmetic-04-035",
      "number": 35,
      "question": "If 4 men and 6 women can do a work in 8 days, and 3 men and 7 women can do it in 10 days, in how many days will 10 women do it?",
      "options": {
        "A": "35",
        "B": "40",
        "C": "45",
        "D": "50"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "8(4M+6W) = 10(3M+7W) => 32M+48W = 30M+70W => 2M=22W => 1M=11W. Total work = 8(4*11W+6W) = 8(50W) = 400W. 10 women take 400/10 = 40 days.",
      "hash": "33fb50f80ae56992",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "यदि 4 पुरुष और 6 महिलाएं एक काम को 8 दिनों में कर सकते हैं, और 3 पुरुष और 7 महिलाएं इसे 10 दिनों में कर सकते हैं, तो 10 महिलाएं इसे कितने दिनों में करेंगी?",
          "options": {
            "A": "35",
            "B": "40",
            "C": "45",
            "D": "50"
          },
          "explanation": "1M=11W. कुल कार्य = 400W. 10 महिलाएं 400/10 = 40 दिन लेंगी।"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
